---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = "Gulf-Return Business Package | BRNDNUR Advisory LLP";
const description = "Dedicated business setup and trademark advisory for Non-Resident Indians (NRIs) and Gulf returnees establishing enterprises in Kerala and across India.";
const canonical = "https://brndnur.com/packages/gulf-return-business/";
---

<BaseLayout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  canonical={canonical}
  currentPath="/packages/gulf-return-business/"
>
  <main id="main-content">
    <!-- Breadcrumb & Hero -->
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <nav class="bn-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
          <a href="/">Home</a>
          <span class="sep">/</span>
          <a href="/packages/">Packages</a>
          <span class="sep">/</span>
          <span class="current">Gulf-Return Business Package</span>
        </nav>
        <p class="eyebrow">Repatriate & Invest</p>
        <h1>Gulf-Return Business Package.</h1>
        <p class="lead">Specialized advisory designed for Non-Resident Indians (NRIs) and Gulf returnees establishing ventures in Kerala. Synchronizes business entity setup, intellectual property defense, and regulatory licensing under one seamless umbrella.</p>
        
        <div class="hero-badges">
          <div class="hero-badge-item">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"/><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"/></svg>
            <span>NRI & Gulf Returnee Specialized Focus</span>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-badge-item">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M3 21h18M3 10h18M5 6l7-3 7 3M4 10v11M20 10v11M8 14v4M12 14v4M16 14v4"/></svg>
            <span>Entity Setup & Corporate Banking Guidance</span>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-badge-item">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
            <span>Pre-Launch Trademark Clearance</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="actions" style="margin-top: 28px;">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://wa.me/919048188899?text=Hello%20BRNDNUR%2C%20I%20am%20interested%20in%20the%20Gulf-Return%20Business%20Package." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Inquire About This Package &rarr;</a>
          <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/packages/">All Packages</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Split Visual Section -->
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="split-row">
          <div class="split-photo">
            <img src="/packages/assets/gulf-business-package.webp" alt="BRNDNUR Gulf-Return Business Package advisory in Kerala" width="800" height="600" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <div class="split-copy">
            <p class="eyebrow">Enterprise Repatriation</p>
            <h2>Guiding Kerala’s Global Returnees to Commercial Success</h2>
            <p>Tens of thousands of Malayalis build successful careers and enterprises in the UAE, Saudi Arabia, Qatar, Oman, Kuwait, and Bahrain, eventually seeking to channel their capital and expertise into ventures back home in Kerala.</p>
            <p>However, navigating Indian regulatory compliance—including entity incorporation, NRE/NRO banking transitions, GST thresholds, and trademark registration—can prove challenging from abroad. BRNDNUR Advisory acts as your on-ground advisory partner in Manjeri, coordinating your complete legal setup before your physical relocation or grand opening.</p>
            <div class="advisory-notice" style="margin-top: 16px;">
              <div class="advisory-notice-icon">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="12"/><line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12.01" y2="16"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div class="advisory-notice-content">
                <h4>FEMA & Overseas Investment Clarity</h4>
                <p>We advise on structural options that comply with the Foreign Exchange Management Act (FEMA) and Reserve Bank of India (RBI) guidelines, ensuring smooth investment routing and business bank account opening.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 4 Package Pillars with Clean SVGs -->
    <section class="section section-alt">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading text-center">
          <p class="eyebrow">Package Inclusions</p>
          <h2>Four Strategic Pillars for Returning Entrepreneurs</h2>
          <p>Everything required to launch a compliant, protected commercial venture in Kerala:</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card-grid">
          <div class="bn-card">
            <div class="card-icon" style="color: #A8781A;">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M3 21h18M3 10h18M5 6l7-3 7 3M4 10v11M20 10v11M8 14v4M12 14v4M16 14v4"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Entity Constitution Setup</h3>
            <p>Strategic consultation to select and register the right entity—Sole Proprietorship, Partnership Firm, LLP, or Private Limited Company—based on scale and investor count.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bn-card">
            <div class="card-icon" style="color: #A8781A;">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Brand & Trademark Clearance</h3>
            <p>Preliminary search across Indian databases to secure your brand name before capital is deployed into store interiors, signage, packaging, or stock.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bn-card">
            <div class="card-icon" style="color: #A8781A;">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Tax & Statutory Registrations</h3>
            <p>End-to-end assistance securing GSTIN, Udyam MSME certificate (unlocking 50% trademark fee discount), PAN/TAN, and professional tax enrollment.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bn-card">
            <div class="card-icon" style="color: #A8781A;">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M16 8h-6a2 2 0 1 0 0 4h4a2 2 0 1 1 0 4H8"/><line x1="12" y1="18" x2="12" y2="6"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Banking & Government Subsidies</h3>
            <p>Guidance on opening domestic business current accounts and exploring state industrial development schemes (e.g., KSIDC, MSME credit guarantee).</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Onboarding Roadmap Table -->
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading text-center">
          <p class="eyebrow">Onboarding Roadmap</p>
          <h2>Gulf-Return Business Onboarding Stages</h2>
          <p>Chronological milestones from initial digital consultation to commercial launch.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bn-table-wrap">
          <table class="bn-table">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Phase</th>
                <th>Focus Area</th>
                <th>Key Deliverables</th>
                <th>Execution Mode</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>Phase 1: Diagnostic</strong></td>
                <td>Entity & Name Feasibility</td>
                <td>Trademark search report + Entity structure recommendation</td>
                <td>Remote video / WhatsApp call from Gulf</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>Phase 2: Incorporation</strong></td>
                <td>Registration & Filings</td>
                <td>Incorporation / Deed execution, PAN/TAN allocation</td>
                <td>Digital drafting & official filing</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>Phase 3: Licensing</strong></td>
                <td>Tax & Operational Approvals</td>
                <td>GSTIN issuance, Udyam certificate, FSSAI / Trade license</td>
                <td>Portal submission & liaison</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>Phase 4: Launch</strong></td>
                <td>Brand Exclusivity & Banking</td>
                <td>Form TM-A filing receipt (&trade; symbol), Current account documents</td>
                <td>On-ground handoff in Kerala</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Call to Action -->
    <section class="cta-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="cta-panel">
          <p class="eyebrow">Plan Your Venture</p>
          <h2>Returning to Kerala to Start a Business?</h2>
          <p>Schedule a confidential consultation with our advisory directors in Manjeri to map out your setup roadmap.</p>
          <div class="cta-actions">
            <a class="btn btn-gold" href="https://wa.me/919048188899?text=Hello%20BRNDNUR%2C%20I%20am%20an%20NRI%20planning%20to%20start%20a%20business%20in%20Kerala." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Discuss on WhatsApp &rarr;</a>
            <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/contact/">Connect via Email / Phone</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
